{"id": 53, "name": "Lesley", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/f/f1/Hero531-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021141920", "cls": ["Marksman", "Assassin"], "specialty": ["Finisher", "Burst"], "difficulty": "40", "stats": ["10", "70", "20", "40"], "lanes": ["Gold Lane", ""], "story": "Adopted daughter of House Vance, a clandestine sniper.", "skills": [{"name": "Lethal Shot", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_296a3745ef0ec7c978400b3e7f481030.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "If Lesley doesn't take damage for 5s, her next Basic Attack gains extra range and 50% Crit Chance and deals 100<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#ffe63c\">True Damage</span> (20% extra damage against minions).\nEach point of fixed Physical Penetration and each 1% Physical Penetration Lesley acquires is converted into 1% Crit Damage, but her base Crit Damage is reduced to 130%.\nLesley's Basic Attack restores 5 points of energy and her <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Lethal Shot</span> doubles the amount of energy restored. The <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Lethal Shot</span> effect will activate immediately after Lesley uses a skill."}, {"name": "Master of Camouflage", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_a8caf30fc02cfaa2f500311936dbfc31.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 3.5   Energy Cost: 30", "desc": "Lesley enters the Camouflage state, gaining double Energy Regen, 40% extra Movement Speed, and 85 extra Physical Attack.\n\nThe state lasts 3s or until Lesley takes or deals damage. Enemies can detect Lesley's position through distortions of their surroundings."}, {"name": "Tactical Grenade", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_18a15ed9f8facd0926ea8a8ecd200e25.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 10   Energy Cost: 40", "desc": "Lesley throws a tactical grenade in the target direction while jumping back slightly, dealing 150<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+50% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in a fan-shaped area and knocking them back.\n\nLesley can cast this skill during <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Ultimate Snipe</span> to cancel the state and immediately fire a Fatal Bullet at the target. The attack is only triggered when there are unfired Fatal Bullets left."}, {"name": "Ultimate Snipe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_c6126c3a551ed56f43e76df1f21510d2.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 40", "desc": "<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Passive</span>: Lesley's Crit Chance is increased by 10%.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Active</span>: Lesley locks onto the target enemy hero and fires 4 Fatal Bullets in succession, each dealing 250<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+80% Extra Physical Attack)</span> (+5% target's lost HP) <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> and restoring 10 energy on hit (Bullets can be blocked by other enemy heroes).\nIf this skill is interrupted, each remaining Bullet reduces the skill cooldown by 10%."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Rapid Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_d68aaf3f8586be360a0b4058d15d2775.png"}, {"name": "Blade of Despair", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f9fa31f80ff0aa02216bc85efe81ea1f.png"}, {"name": "Blade of Despair", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f9fa31f80ff0aa02216bc85efe81ea1f.png"}, {"name": "Blade of Despair", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f9